    "answer": {
      "short": "$0.47$",
      "worked": "Let $P(C)=P(D)=x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}0.3+0.24+x+x&=1\\\\2x&=1-0.3-0.24\\\\2x&=0.46\\\\x&=0.23\\\\P(B\\text{ or }C)&=0.24+0.23\\\\P(B\\text{ or }C)&=0.47\\end{align*}$$",
